OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to use empty bank unit as
OL,4,Abetting shop rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FA betting company's application to take
OL,7,Fover a unit previously used as a bank
OL,8,Fhas been dismissed after a council said
OL,9,Fit had not proved it would "enhance
OL,10,Fvitality and viability".
OL,12,FBarclays last used the three-storey
OL,13,Fbuilding in High Street, Maidenhead, in
OL,14,FApril 2024.
OL,16,FBoyleSports applied to the Royal
OL,17,FBorough of Windsor and Maidenhead
OL,18,F(RBWM) to reuse it, but the authority
OL,19,Frejected the application for the
OL,20,F"prominent use" in the town centre.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
